# Optional. Extra devnet RPC endpoints, comma-separated, tried BEFORE the public
# https://api.devnet.solana.com (which stays as the fallback). Leave empty to use only the public
# endpoint with exponential backoff. Never commit a URL that contains an API key: put it in your
# shell, an untracked .env.local, or (for the Pages build) the repository secret of the same name.
# Whatever is set here is compiled into the public bundle, so restrict it by allowed origin at the
# provider and use a devnet-only key.
VITE_RPC_FALLBACK=
